# Upload manifest for `gcloud run deploy --source cloudrun/`.
#
# This file existing is LOAD-BEARING: without it gcloud inherits the repo
# .gitignore, which ignores the copied index.html/robots.txt — the build
# would then fail (or worse, quietly bake an image without the page).
# Exclude only what the image build doesn't need.
.gcloudignore
CLOUDRUN.md
deploy.sh
